* Four binary low bits plus fifteen weight-16 thermometer cells.
* Includes supplied by parent deck; actual combinational decoder/drivers, no retiming.
.subckt pt_dac_segmented8 OP ON BN VDD VSS D0 D1 D2 D3 D4 D5 D6 D7
XDEC D4 D5 D6 D7 T1 T2 T3 T4 T5 T6 T7 T8 T9 T10 T11 T12 T13 T14 T15 VDD VSS pt_dac_thermometer4
XDL0 D0 L0 L0B VDD VSS pt_adc_code_small_driver WEIGHT=1
XCL0 OP ON L0 L0B BN VSS pt_dac_current_bit WGT=1
XDL1 D1 L1 L1B VDD VSS pt_adc_code_small_driver WEIGHT=2
XCL1 OP ON L1 L1B BN VSS pt_dac_current_bit WGT=2
XDL2 D2 L2 L2B VDD VSS pt_adc_code_small_driver WEIGHT=4
XCL2 OP ON L2 L2B BN VSS pt_dac_current_bit WGT=4
XDL3 D3 L3 L3B VDD VSS pt_adc_code_small_driver WEIGHT=8
XCL3 OP ON L3 L3B BN VSS pt_dac_current_bit WGT=8
XDH1 T1 H1 H1B VDD VSS pt_adc_code_small_driver WEIGHT=16
XCH1 OP ON H1 H1B BN VSS pt_dac_current_bit WGT=16
XDH2 T2 H2 H2B VDD VSS pt_adc_code_small_driver WEIGHT=16
XCH2 OP ON H2 H2B BN VSS pt_dac_current_bit WGT=16
